<section id="diferenciais" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <span class="text-primary font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Diferenciais</span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-text-heading mt-3">
      O &uacute;nico app do mundo com IA<br/>adaptada por abordagem
    </h2>
    <p class="text-text-muted mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      Enquanto outros sistemas tratam todas as sess&otilde;es da mesma forma,
      o MentAll adapta a an&aacute;lise cl&iacute;nica para 14 abordagens diferentes.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-14">
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover group">
      <div class="icon-box bg-blue-50 text-primary group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-heading mt-5 mb-3">IA que respeita sua abordagem</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        TCC, Psican&aacute;lise, ACT, DBT, Terapia do Esquema, Gestalt, Humanista e mais.
        A IA gera s&iacute;nteses, formula&ccedil;&otilde;es e apontamentos adaptados ao seu referencial te&oacute;rico.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover group">
      <div class="icon-box bg-green-50 text-green-600 group-hover:bg-green-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-heading mt-5 mb-3">Prontu&aacute;rio offline nativo</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Funciona sem internet. Dados criptografados no seu celular com AES-256.
        Grave &aacute;udios, transcreva, gere s&iacute;nteses &mdash; tudo localmente ou via nuvem quando conectado.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover group">
      <div class="icon-box bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 group-hover:bg-amber-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-heading mt-5 mb-3">Artigos cient&iacute;ficos reais</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Em vez de inventar refer&ecirc;ncias, o MentAll busca artigos reais no OpenAlex
        e usa IA para selecionar os mais relevantes ao contexto cl&iacute;nico da sess&atilde;o. Sem alucina&ccedil;&otilde;es.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
